<p>Maula Abbas - 4<br> Maula Hain Hamare Dil Unhe Pukare Bin Bazuo Ke Jo Taqdeere Likhte Hain<br> Babul Hawaij Fazl ke Baba Baali Sakina Ke Hain Chacha<br> Unko Bulao Sab Gham Sunao Hain Woh Sakhi Badshah</p> 
<p>Ya Abbas<br> Diya Jalake Sakina Ke Naam Ka Ghar Me<br> Janabe Hazrat e Abbas Ko Bulaya Karo - 2</p> 
<p>Kaha Kaha Wo Hamari Madad Nahi Karte<br> Kasam Sakina Ki Abbas Rad Nahi Karte -2<br> Baghair Mange Wo Sab Kuch Ata Karenge Tumhe<br> Sakina Bibi Ka Farshe Aza Bichaya Karo</p> 
<p>Diya Jalake.....</p> 
<p>Bahut Qareeb Hain Abbas Ke Yeh Shehzadi<br> Jo Dekhni Ho Muhabbat Chacha Bhatiji Ki-2<br> Tum Apne Ghar Me Sajate Hue Azakhana<br> Alam Pe Choti Si Ek Mashq Sajaya Karo</p> 
<p>Diya Jalake.....</p> 
<p>Misaal E Karbobala Hain Karam Nawazi Ki<br> Ye Kamsini Me Bhi Mushkil Kusha Hain Ghazi Ki - 2<br> Chacha Se Kehke Ghamon Se Tumhe Chuda Lengi<br> Sakina Bibi Ko Sab Haale Dil Sunaya Karo</p> 
<p>Diya Jalake.....</p> 
<p>Ay Kaash Dekhle Ghazi Hamare Ghar Ki Taraf<br> Ata Ho Aath Moharram Ko Haazri Ka Sharaf -2<br> Chacha Ke Saath Bhatiji Bhi Mere Ghar Aaye<br> Dua Ye Mang Ke Ghazi Ki Nazr Khaya Karo</p> 
<p>Diya Jalake.....</p> 
<p>Tum Iske Naam Ki Mannat Uthake Mango Dua<br> Hussain Sadqe Me Iske Karenge Beti Ata - 2<br> Tumhare Ghar Me Jab Aajaye Chand Se Beti<br> Kaneez e Bali Sakina Use Banaya Karo</p> 
<p>Diya Jalake.....</p> 
<p>Jise Namazon Me Manga Sukoon Sukoon Kehkar<br> Sukoon Kaise Mile Woh Nazar Na Aaye Agar - 2<br> Jise Bulake Yeh Aksar Hussain Kehte The<br> Sakina Ham Se Kabhi Dur Tum Na Jaaya Karo</p> 
<p>Diya Jalake.....</p> 
<p>Salam Uspe Jo Girti Sambhalti Rehti Thi<br> Wo Jiske Gaalon Ki Rangat Badalti Rehti Thi - 2<br> Tamache Khake Wo Zaalim Se Roke Kehti Rahi<br> Main Ek Yateem Hun Mujh Par Na Haath Uthaya Karo&nbsp;</p> 
<p>Diya Jalake.....</p> 
<p>Ye Zaireen Se Zeeshan Aur Raza Kehdo<br> Kisi Ka Shaam Agar Karbala Se Jaana Hon - 2<br> Lahad Pe Bibi Ke Ek Mashq Saath Le Jaakar<br> Ye Pani Bheja Hain Abbas Ne Bataya Karo</p> 
<p>Diya Jalake.....</p> 
